  "interpretation": [
    "Both baseline epochs at front face x=3.00 m select map-local wall x centers 3.05, 2.95, 3.05 m; all three shifted-wall runs at front face x=3.05 m select x=3.05 m at each snapshot.",
    "In #296, all 72 first-snapshot wall centers beyond the exploratory 0.10 m SDF distance inverse-transform to map x=2.95 m; alignment shifts their x by median −54.5 mm (P05/P95 −61.2/−50.4 mm). #302 has no occupied center beyond 0.10 m; its SDF median/P95/maximum are 0.75/1.43/5.76 cm, 0.72/1.58/6.63 cm, and 0.65/1.56/5.76 cm.",
    "The phase-targeted #302 samples occur 1.748, 4.157, and 6.863 s after the first force command, within 0.1 s of #295 at all three samples. This strongly supports wall/grid phase as a driver of the side switch and #296 threshold tail, but does not prove root cause or rule out other map errors or ghosting."
  ],
